经验，3年以上同岗位管理经验，有三电量产项目经验者优先。\n（二）专业技能（核心重点）\n1.  精通三电系统核心技术（电池集成与管理、电机控制、电控软硬件设计及三电协同控制），具备方案设计、量产导入及技术问题解决能力，能独立主导三电系统整体方案论证与优化。\n2.  熟悉新能源汽车行业标准，具备供应商技术评审、资源整合能力及技术文档撰写能力，了解三电前沿技术（如800V高压平台、高效扁线电机等）。\n3.  掌握三电系统仿真分析工具（如MATLAB/Simulink、ANSYS等），能完成三电性能仿真、可靠性验证及性能优化工作。\n4.  具备三电系统故障诊断、问题分析及整改能力，能高效处理研发、量产及售后环节的三电相关技术异常。\n5.  了解三电系统热管理集成技术，能统筹三电各部件热管理匹配与优化，提升系统效率与安全性。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-05-08T20:13:55","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"d043511b-4e0a-4950-97bc-bd1ddfb81d54","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270931486,"PostDateInt":1778242381000,"PostDate":"2026-05-08T20:13:01","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"域控系统工程师","OrgId":1658196,"Org":"能源装备事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["湖南省·株洲市·石峰区"],"Salary":"13K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1.  负责整车域控系统（含动力域、底盘域、车身域、智能座舱域等）技术规划与技术路线选型，把控方案可行性、可靠性及成本，解决核心技术难题。\n2.  技术对接芯片、软件、硬件供应商及合作伙伴。\n3.  跟踪域控行业前沿技术（如中央计算平台、SOA架构、以太网通信等），推动技术预研与成果转化；\n4.  配合相关部门解决量产、售后技术问题，制定质量改进方案。","Require":"一）教育背景\n本科及以上学历，车辆工程、电子信息工程、自动化、计算机科学与技术等相关专业，硕士优先；有量产项目经验者优先。\n（二）专业技能\n1.  精通整车域控核心技术（域控制器硬件设计、软件架构、通信协议等），具备丰富的方案设计、仿真验证及量产导入经验，能解决关键技术瓶颈。\n2.  熟悉汽车电子行业法规与相关标准，了解域控前沿技术趋势；具备供应商技术评审、资源整合能力及良好的技术文档撰写能力。\n3.  熟悉中央计算平台、SOA架构、以太网等前沿技术，或拥有相关技术专利者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-05-08T20:13:01","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null}],"Total":0}